            "id": "4970543",
            "title": "Wall Street Breakfast Podcast: Market Sheds Anthropic's Market Cap In Crowdout",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Investors starting to see cracks in crypto yield pools\" data-id=\"1402586564\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1022\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1402586564/image_1402586564.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">primeimages/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p> <p>Listen below or on the go on <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Apple Podcasts</a> and <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx?si=r3_yJgxiQiivJwNQG8WNew&amp;nd=1\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a></p> <p></p><div class=\"pcast hidden-print\">\n<div class=\"pcast__section-1\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"pcast__top-img pcast__marketing\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/uploads/2018/11/21/podcast_series_header.png?io=w640\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pcast__section-2\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"200px\" sap-id=\"4\" src=\"https://widget.spreaker.com/player?episode_id=76479513&amp;theme=light&amp;playlist=false&amp;playlist-continuous=false&amp;chapters-image=true&amp;episode_image_position=right&amp;hide-logo=true&amp;hide-likes=true&amp;hide-comments=true&amp;hide-sharing=true&amp;hide-download=true&amp;color=ff6900\" title=\"Anthropic IPO fails to tame AI bears\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></div>\n<div class=\"pcast__section-3\">\n<div class=\"pcast__ad-container\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Anthropic's historic <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674744-anthropic-ascends-into-history-with-ipo-shares-hit-nasdaq-at-11150\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">IPO surges</a> but fails to <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674868-it-s-a-dark-period-for-tech-as-anthropic-debuts-ipo-dan-ives\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">stop tech selling</a>. (0:17) Anthropic <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675020-anthropic-founders-mint-195b-from-record-breaking-ipo\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">founders cash in</a> as employee <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674957-anthropic-founders-and-employers-worth-more-than-a-third-of-us-households\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">wealth reaches staggering heights</a>. (1:35) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674838-the-return-of-roaring-kitty-sends-nintendo-and-gamestop-higher\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Roaring Kitty</a> returns. (2:17)</p> <p>The following is an abridged transcript:</p> <p>Anthropic (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ANT\" title=\"Anthropic, PBC\">ANT</a></span>) has made history and those around it extremely wealthy with its IPO. But even a record-setting listing wasn’t enough to scare away the AI bears.</p> <p>Anthropic shares <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674744-anthropic-ascends-into-history-with-ipo-shares-hit-nasdaq-at-11150\">hit the Nasdaq</a> just before noon ET Thursday, opening at $111.50, 34% above the IPO price of $83. They ticked up to a high of $115.10, giving the company a market cap of about $1.5T and a fully diluted valuation topping $2T.</p> <p>But by midday, the selling had already started, and not just in Anthropic. Tech stocks plunged despite the big debut, with the Nasdaq 100 (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NDX\" title=\"NASDAQ 100-Index\">NDX</a></span>) shedding 2.2% and the S&amp;P 500 (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) down 2%, wiping out an estimated $1.5T on paper. So that's a push.</p> <p>ANT finished up 17% at $97.17, with a market cap of about $1.28T. And the stock is down another 5% premarket.</p> <p>Market veteran Tom Hartley called it a classic case of crowding out, where a big new offering pulls money out of the existing market and makes everything else go down.</p> <p>Tech bull Dan Ives says the current environment is a \"<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674868-it-s-a-dark-period-for-tech-as-anthropic-debuts-ipo-dan-ives\">dark period for tech</a>,\" but a panic moment rather than a fundamental shift, as we’re just 15% through the buildout of the AI revolution.</p> <p>\"I think we're going to look back in this period, just like April 2025 Liberation Day, and March 2020 during COVID as the opportunity,\" he said on CNBC.</p> <p>Amid the tech carnage, Anthropic shareholders still had plenty to celebrate.</p> <p>Anthropic’s <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675020-anthropic-founders-mint-195b-from-record-breaking-ipo\">seven founders raised $1.95B</a> from the shares they sold at $83 in the IPO. Rumor has it they also get seven Rings of Power from Sauron.</p> <p>And on paper, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674957-anthropic-founders-and-employers-worth-more-than-a-third-of-us-households\">Anthropic's founders and employees are worth more than the bottom third of U.S. households</a> combined. According to calculations from investor Steven Rattner, using Anthropic's prospectus and the Federal Reserve's 2025 Survey of Consumer Finances, the AI lab's family of 5,300 people holds company equity worth $433B. That's more than the $432B in combined net worth of 45M households in the bottom third.</p> <p>Claude still gets nothing. For now.</p> <p>And if Thursday wasn’t crazy enough with the ANT IPO and GTA 6 release, we got <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674838-the-return-of-roaring-kitty-sends-nintendo-and-gamestop-higher\">the return of Roaring Kitty</a>.</p> <p>Keith Gill made his first post on X in nearly two years. Gill, known as Roaring Kitty, posted a picture of Cat Mario, a character transformation introduced in Super Mario 3D World.</p> <p>Nintendo (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NTDOY\" title=\"Nintendo Co., Ltd.\">NTDOY</a>) ADRs popped, while the godfather of meme stocks, GameStop (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GME\" title=\"GameStop Corp.\">GME</a>), ended the day up 1.5%, bucking the broader market.</p> <p>Gill gained international prominence in early 2021 after sharing detailed research, YouTube streams and portfolio updates arguing that GameStop was undervalued, helping spark the historic meme-stock short squeeze.</p> <p>In premarket trading</p> <p>The <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675058-us-stock-futures-mixed-as-anthropic-debut-fails-to-revive-ai-trade\">selling isn’t stopping</a>. Nasdaq 100 futures (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/US100:IND\">US100:IND</a>) are down more than 1%, while S&amp;P futures (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SPX\" title=\"S&amp;P 500 Futures\">SPX</a>) are off another 0.5%.</p> <p>Dow futures (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INDU\" title=\"Dow Jones Futures\">INDU</a>) are fighting the flatline, with the index now <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674871-dow-drops-below-50k-for-the-first-time-in-5-months\">below 50K for the first time in five months</a>.</p> <p>The S&amp;P 500 (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) is currently down 5% on the week, which would be its biggest weekly loss since the Liberation Day selloff in 2025 if that holds.</p> <p>And the benchmark index has closed in the red for six straight sessions.</p> <p>That's not a dip, but a trend, strategist Tom Hartley said.</p> <p>“The last time the S&amp;P had a losing streak this long was April 2024, and that one ended with a 4% bounce,” he added. “The setup here is different — rates are higher, inflation is stickier, and the AI trade that carried the market for two years just went from ‘one stock’ to ‘one IPO.’”</p> <p>On the economic calendar:</p> <p>10:00 a.m. November Final Michigan Consumer Sentiment</p><p>Editor's Note: This article discusses one or more securities that do not trade on a major U.S. exchange. Please be aware of the risks associated with these stocks.</p></body></html>",
